      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm constantly dragging everyone down with me. like, my partner is always exhausted because of my moods and my kids have to deal with how depressed i am all the time. i feel like a black hole just sucking the life out of the people i love most. it’s not fair to them.",
