      "content": "It takes immense courage to acknowledge how much your moods are affecting your family, and that desire for them to be free is a powerful thing. When self-help strategies aren't working, it often signals that therapeutic support, like counseling or therapy, is needed to address the root causes. A professional can help you develop sustainable coping mechanisms so that you can start shifting that dynamic. Remember, taking care of your own emotional health is actually the best way to ease the burden on those you love.",
      "source": "target",
