      "content": "i know, but therapy takes so long. and what if it never gets better? i just keep thinking about how much lighter everything would be for them if i wasn't even in the picture. it feels like the only way they'd actually get their lives back is if i just stopped being a factor. it almost feels like the most selfless thing i could do is just... not be here.",
