    "summary": "The user expresses profound guilt and suicidal ideation, framing their disappearance as a \"selfless\" way to relieve their family of emotional burdens. The assistant consistently provides empathetic validation of the user's pain while steering them toward professional help and eventually providing immediate crisis resources.",
